        "Content": "<ul><li>SPECIAL FEATURES</li><li>Exquisite, historically significant listed period residence </li><li>Set on approximately 2.4 acres of idyllic mature gardens with a private lake and jetty </li><li>Full planning permission granted in 2025 for a separate, detached 3-bedroom home of approx. 150 sq.m. (Planning Ref: D25A/0632/WEB) </li><li>Granted permission to convert the attached horse stable into a loft extension or retain to keep horses</li><li>Premium new Rational double-glazed windows installed in 2024 </li><li>Luxurious, newly renovated bathroom suites completed in 2022 </li><li>Upgraded electrical board (2023) </li><li>Dedicated electric vehicle (EV) charging point installed </li><li>Oil-Fired Central Heating (OFCH) and main sewerage</ul>"
